<article class="env-corollary" id="518C">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/518C">Corollary <span data-tag="518C">2.4.7.11</span>.</a> Let $\calC $ be an $\infty $-category. Evaluation at the endpoints gives a bifibration $\Fun (\Delta ^1,\calC ) \rightarrow \calC \times \calC $. </p>
</article>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Apply Proposition <a href="/tag/1C14" data-tag="1C14">2.4.7.10</a> to the correspondence $\calC \times \Delta ^1$. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>